<title>USA: Apartment Investment buys three properties.</title>
<headline>Apartment Investment buys three properties.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apartment Investment and Management Co said on Tuesday it completed the acquisition of three multifamily apartment properties units located in Texas and Florida for a total of $27 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition price includes $3 million which the company budgeted for initial capital expenditures, it said.</p>
<p>Apartment Investment said it expected the combined stabilized contribution to its cash earned to be $0.03 to $0.04 per share.</p>
<p>The properties are in Houston and Corpus Christi, Texas and Tampa, Florida.</p>
</text>
